<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63994" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχμ-η</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέχομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thicket, copse</i>, esp. as the <i>lair</i> of wild
			beasts, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν λόχμῃ πυκινῇ κατέκειτο μέγας σῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.439
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχμας ὕπο κυανέας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					6.40
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>P.</u>
				4.244
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχῖνος ὥς τις ἐν λόχμῃ κεῖσαι πεσών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					121
				</span></i>
			: in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχμαισι δοκεύσαις</span>
			lying in wait <i>in the coppice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				10(11).30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μασχάλαι λόχμης δασύτεραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					61
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				800
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μία λ. δύο ἐριθάκους οὐ
				τρέφει</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				922
			</span></i>: also in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				615a17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				13.14
			</span></i>, Creophyl. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.361d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχμη τῶν θηρίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Mis.</u>
					338c
				</span></i>
			.</div>
